  "details": "In the Main Menu, the colors of text and used of stylized capitalization differs on each page: worlds, avatars, and social.\n\n- Worlds has \"Current World\" with blue icons, white text, and camel case capitalization.\n\n- Avatars has \"CURRENT AVATARS\" with gray icons and text, and all caps capitalization.\n\n- Social has \"STATUS\" with blue icons, white text, and  all caps capitalization.\n\nExpected behavior: Consistent styling. Namely: Blue icons, white text, and perhaps all camel case capitalization.\n\nActual behavior: Mixed styling with a mix of blue & gray icons, a mix of gray & white text, and a mix of capitalization writing formats.",
